{"ts":"2026-07-11T16:22:48.239Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"Promoted from the pm-mpbb DX ledger (candidate lever a) on 2026-07-11, when the pm-a22j baseline gate opened (full AC met: checked-in script scripts/measure-agent-token-surface.mjs + MCP tools/list = 32,979 B ~= 8.2k tok / 28 tools).\n\nThe a22j baseline measures the cost of the SURFACE (help/contracts/tools-list payload sizes). Nothing measures what an agent actually pays per completed task: tokens read + retries burned across a realistic command sequence. Without that, DX regressions (verbose new output, envelope bloat, extra confirmation rounds) stay invisible until a human notices.\n\nApproach (per the ledger fence: extend, never a new harness):\n- Record golden agent transcripts (ordered pm command sequences with expected envelopes) for a handful of canonical tasks: triage-and-claim, create-with-deps, close-with-resolution, context bootstrap.\n- Replay them against the current build and report total bytes/approx-tokens per completed task.\n- Wire the result into the existing token-cost CI gate lineage (pm-cu1i, shipped PR#487) with a documented regression threshold, exactly like the changelog and contracts drift gates.\n\nBoundary: pm-atfm (related) grades context/next assembly QUALITY with rank-aware metrics; this item measures token COST per task. Keep the corpora separate; the replay runner may share golden-workspace fixtures."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-8pnj"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Golden agent-transcript replay: measure tokens-per-completed-task as a CI-visible DX regression gate"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":""},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Feature"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","area:ci","measurement","simplification"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-11T16:22:48.239Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-11T16:22:48.239Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":240},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Golden transcript corpus (canonical agent task sequences) versioned in-repo; replay runner reports bytes+approx-tokens per completed task against the current build; wired into the existing token-cost CI gate lineage with a documented regression threshold; boundary with pm-atfm quality harness documented; workflow for adding transcripts documented"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-mpbb"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-atfm","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-11T16:22:48.239Z"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"5a2dfa0c4b01ad151c945d50737e563441f7f0af778a7cf4447ab4ee48f98a7a","message":""}
